<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/styles.css">
  <title>French Creek Carpentry Services</title>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include("partials/header.ejs") %>
  <div class="main-container services-layout">
    <div class="services-header page-intro">
      <h1>Our Services</h1>
      <p>Not only do we construct beautiful custom woodwork for you, we also provide 
         installation and interior paint services!
      </p>
    </div>
    <section class="services-item">
      <div class="services-image">
        <div class="services-gallery">
          <div class="feature-container">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/dark_custom_cabinetry.jpg" alt="Dark shaker cabinets." class="page-image feature-img">
          </div>
          <div class="thumbnail-container">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/dark_custom_cabinetry.jpg" alt="Dark shaker cabinets." class="thumbnail active">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/white_kitchen_shaker_cabinets_round_handles.jpg" alt="Kitchen with white shaker cabinets with round brushed nickel handles" class="thumbnail">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/gray_blue_kitchen_shaker_pull_bars.jpg" alt="Kitchen with gray-blue shaker cabinets with black bar pulls" class="thumbnail">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/basement_bar_cabinets.jpg" alt="Basement bar cabinetry with island and decorative aluminum backside of bar." class="thumbnail">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="services-description">
        <h2>Custom Cabinetry</h2>
        <p>Need custom cabinetry sizes for your kitchen or bathroom remodel? Let us build some
          beautifully crafted new cabinets for your project!   
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="services-item">
      <div class="services-image">
        <div class="services-gallery">
          <div class="feature-container">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/bunk_beds.jpg" alt="Two dark wood custom made bunk beds." class="page-image feature-img">
          </div>
          <div class="thumbnail-container">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/bunk_beds.jpg" alt="Two dark wood custom made bunk beds." class="thumbnail active">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/bathroom_shiplap.jpg" alt="Bathroom with white shiplap walls installed by French Creek Carpentry." class="thumbnail">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/before_after_custom_banister.jpg" alt="Before and after photos of custom banister work." class="thumbnail">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/before_after_custom_bookshelves.jpg" alt="Before and after photos of custom built-in bookshelves." class="thumbnail">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/before_after_closet_flooring.jpg" alt="Before and after photos of closet flooring going from carpet to wood." class="thumbnail">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/before_after_six_panel_door.jpg" alt="Before and after photos of custom six panel door" class="thumbnail">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/before_after_two_panel_door.jpg" alt="Before and after of custom two panel door" class="thumbnail">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="services-description">
        <h2>Custom Millwork and Furniture</h2>
        <p>Tired of the boring cookie-cutter feel, we can help transform your house customized to you!
          From accent walls to doors to new hardwood floors and inlays, we've got you covered!
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="services-item">
      <div class="services-image">
        <div class="services-gallery">
          <div class="feature-container">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/dark_shaker_kitchen_cabinets.jpg" alt="Living room and kitchen with custom cabinetry, trim, and paint services. Dark Shaker style cabinets in kitchen." class="page-image feature-img">
          </div>
          <div class="thumbnail-container">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/dark_shaker_kitchen_cabinets.jpg" alt="Living room and kitchen with custom cabinetry, trim, and paint services. Dark Shaker style cabinets in kitchen." class="thumbnail active">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/tile_paint_trim_bathroom.jpg" alt="Bathroom picture of French Creek Carpentry tile, paint, trim, and custom cabinetry installation, white." class="thumbnail">
            <img src="./images/services_photos/before_after_beams_ceiling_fireplace_paint.jpg" alt="Before and after photos of living room with new ceiling cladding and beams, custom fireplace mantle, and paint job." class="thumbnail">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="services-description">
        <h2>All Services</h2>
        <p>Check out photos of our projects where we have incorporated all of our services.
           Installation of our captivating custom cabinetry, radiantly tasteful trim and tile work, 
           and invigorating interior painting. 
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <%- include("partials/footer.ejs") %>
  <script src="/js/gallery.js"></script>
</body>
</html>